'''Kyuubei''' (きゅうべえ, ''Kyūbē'', '''Kyubey''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kyuubei
|image = E 278.png
|appearance = [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 150¢ - 592¢
}}

==Enemy==
Kyuubei is essentially a stronger version of [[Kang Roo]] with lower health and movement speed, more knockbacks and attack power, along with less range.

==Strategy==
Due to Kyuubei's Single Target and low range, it is recommended you use [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]] like [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] or [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] paired with ranged attackers like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] to take down Kyuubei.

